{"id":"cri_o","lemma":"crío","pos":"noun","rank":3850,"glosses":["kid, child"],"ipa":"/ˈkɾio/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"críos","feminine":"cría","femininePlural":"crías"},"formAudio":{"cría":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-cr%C3%ADa.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ya no soy un crío.","en":"I'm not a kid anymore.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458646","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"no longer"]]},{"text":"Yo crío ganado.","en":"I raise cattle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440768","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"livestock, cattle"}]},{"text":"Todos nuestros críos van al colegio del barrio.","en":"Our children all go to the local school.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705539","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null,{"g":"van"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"neighbourhood"}]},{"text":"Cuando éramos críos, jugábamos juntos todos los días.","en":"When we were kids, we played together every day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581670","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"to play","l":"jugar"},{"g":"next to","l":"junto"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"day","l":"día"}]},{"text":"Me rehúso a ser tratado como un crío.","en":"I refuse to be treated like a child.","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to refuse","l":"rehusar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"treaty"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}